n":"Yugabyte SQL (YSQL)"},{"id":1419821900,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDE5ODIxOTAw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/priority/medium","name":"priority/medium","color":"ffdc5e","default":false,"description":"Medium priority issue"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"deeps1991","id":21131754,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMTMxNzU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21131754?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991","html_url":"https://github.com/deeps1991","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"deeps1991","id":21131754,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMTMxNzU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21131754?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991","html_url":"https://github.com/deeps1991","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deeps1991/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2023-06-26T19:42:34Z","updated_at":"2023-06-27T00:01:50Z","closed_at":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-7014](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-7014)\r\n### Description\n\nCurrently the pg_inherits table is cached in the YSQL backend. However CREATE PARTITION only increments the catalog version, which means any other connection that has the pg_inherits entries for the parent table will come to know of a new partition only at the end of the ongoing transaction. This can lead to the following scenario:\r\n\r\n- CREATE PARTITIONED TABLE\r\n- Session 1: Create / attach new partition for values in (‘europe’)\r\n- Session 2: Insert rows with partition value ‘europe’\r\n- If session 2 did not see the new partition, it would incorrectly insert the row into default\r\n- If session 2 saw the new partition, it would correctly insert into the new partition\r\n\r\nFix this by incrementing the schema version of the default partition whenever a new partition is created, this will prevent any parallel connection that doesn't have a refreshed cache from spuriously inserting into the default partition.\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-7014]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-7014?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/17942/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/17942/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}